5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I believe we should prioritize quiet observation and trust the information provided by the Seer when it emerges.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. Logic and observation are our best tools. We must be careful not to let emotions cloud our judgment.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I'm going to use my intuition to find the wolf! I'll follow whoever seems the smartest.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll be watching for inconsistencies in everyone's stories. That's usually where the truth hides.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A delightful start. I shall simply enjoy the spectacle of our collective deduction, provided we don't accidentally execute the innocent.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"The Seer's role is pivotal. If the Seer is targeted early, the village loses its only objective compass.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"True, but the Werewolf will likely try to fake that role to sow discord. We must verify claims carefully.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Oh! So the wolf might lie about being the Seer? That's so sneaky! I'll be watching for that!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,It's a common tactic. We should compare the timing of claims and how people react to them.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,How thrilling. A game of masks and mirrors. I wonder who among us is the most skilled actor?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer to keep my thoughts organized. Let us see what the first night reveals before we speculate too much.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,Agreed. Let's maintain a calm atmosphere. Panic only helps the werewolf.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,I'm already thinking about who looks suspicious! But I'll wait for the Seer's news.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,I'll be noting who tries to lead the conversation too aggressively.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Such diligence, Misaki. I'm sure your notes will be a masterpiece of suspicion.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
