31,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have divined Mizuki, and the result is that she is the Werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,That is a blatant lie. I am a villager. Jonathan is likely the werewolf attempting to frame me immediately.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What?! Already?! Jonathan seems so calm, but Mizuki is so confident! I don't know who to believe!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"A day-one claim is bold. Jonathan, why did you choose Mizuki first? Mizuki, your reaction was very fast.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"My, my. A direct hit on the first swing. How efficient, Jonathan. Or perhaps, how desperate?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I chose her randomly, but the result was definitive. I am the Seer, and she is the enemy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"It wasn't ""random."" He's trying to eliminate a strong voice early. If you execute me, you lose a loyal human.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Rin,,Mizuki sounds really sure of herself! Maybe Jonathan is just mistaken? Or lying!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the wolf, he's playing a high-risk game. If Mizuki is the wolf, she's using her confidence as a shield.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,It is a classic dilemma. Do we trust the quiet scholar or the confident leader? The irony is delicious.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The evidence is the divination. Logic dictates that if I am the Seer, Mizuki must go.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Logic also dictates that a werewolf would claim to be the Seer to get a target killed. Don't be fooled.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I think I'll trust Jonathan! He's been so gentle and quiet, he wouldn't lie, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Rin, don't decide so quickly. However, Jonathan's demeanor hasn't shifted, which is a point in his favor.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"While I admire Jonathan's boldness, we must consider the possibility that he's simply a very talented liar.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I have told the truth. The choice is yours, but the risk of keeping her is too high.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am innocent. I urge you all to look at how Benjamin is stirring the pot without taking a side.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Rin,,"Wait, Benjamin is suspicious too? No, I'm sticking with Jonathan! Let's vote Mizuki!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Mizuki's attempt to deflect onto Benjamin is interesting, but the Seer's claim is the most direct lead we have.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I am merely the commentator in this tragedy. But if the village wishes to follow the Seer, I shall not object.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
